    "updated_at": "2022-01-13T15:19:31Z",
    "body": "I don't think this will be easy to implement at this time, because starship doesn't currently use a universal binary and will always be executed with whatever architecture the starship binary itself has. It would need to either probe the parent process or get the information directly from the shell.\r\n\r\nFor now, I suggest you use an [env var](https://starship.rs/config/#environment-variable) module and set appropriate environment variables on shell startup.",
